WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.962
AND means every connected condition must be true for
the row to

00:00:02.988 --> 00:00:07.075
qualify Here the record must be active the age must
be at

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:11.450
least forty and severity must be High If any one
condition is

00:00:11.475 --> 00:00:15.688
false the row does not remain Run the query and
inspect the

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:20.400
result Then imagine removing one condition and
notice that the cohort would

00:00:20.425 --> 00:00:24.625
usually become larger A useful beginner habit is to
read the WHERE

00:00:24.638 --> 00:00:28.888
clause as a sentence If the sentence requires
several things at the

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:34.088
same time AND is usually the correct connector If
you intended alternatives

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.662
OR may be more appropriate
